# Grey Wellness

> Grey Wellness provides bilingual virtual therapy for adults in Maryland, Virginia, and Washington, DC (District of Columbia). Mónica Grey, MS, LCPC, NCC offers care for insomnia, anxiety, and trauma in English and Spanish.

## Practice facts
- Sessions are virtual; no in-person appointments are offered.
- Clients must be physically located in Maryland, Virginia, or Washington, DC at the time of their session.
- Insurance is accepted only for Maryland clients, subject to plan confirmation. Virginia and Washington, DC sessions are self-pay.
- Treatment approaches include Cognitive Behavioral Therapy for Insomnia (CBT-I), CBT, trauma-informed care including Cognitive Processing Therapy (CPT), and mindfulness-based approaches. Treatment is individualized.
- Phone: +1-240-203-8879
- Email: contact@greywellness.com

